B.aLO=s(["View your name and title, level and XP progress, HP, Ability Points, stats, streak, height, and weight.","Spend available AP to upgrade STR, VIT, AGI, INT, or PER. Earn XP by completing quests and level up to advance your title and HP.","Tap your profile details to update your name, height, or weight. You can record weight once per day; resetting Mass Progression Trend clears its saved weight history.","Date of birth is optional and is entered from the profile editor. After you confirm it, it is locked, used to calculate your age, and can trigger a birthday greeting. It is not shown on the main profile.","History in the Labyrinth drawer lets you review quest clears, rewards, level-ups, streaks, weight updates, and food intake."],t.s)
B.b5H=new A.kw(B.z8,"STATUS","Check your profile and invest in your Monarch\u2019s stats.",B.aOH,B.aLO)
